algorithms.pseudocode:
Algorithm ComputeSecondShadow(S, n):
    shadow <- empty set
    for each alpha in S:
        for i = 1 to n:
            for j = 1 to n:
                beta <- copy of alpha
                if i = j:
                    if beta[i] >= 2: beta[i] -= 2; add beta to shadow
                else:
                    if beta[i] >= 1 and beta[j] >= 1:
                        beta[i] -= 1; beta[j] -= 1; add beta to shadow
    return shadow

Complexity: O(|S| * n^2) time, O(|S| * n^2) space
